```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization invitation revoke --help
Revoke an organization invitation

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization invitation revoke [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <INVITATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INVITATION>    Invitation ID

Options:
      --yes                            Confirm this action
      --json                           Print the invitation result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
